## Actions

1. (31) §3: rephrase the double negative "defining good as scoring
   zero on none of the twelve dimensions" → define bad runs as those
   with at least one zero score in any dimension.
2. (28) §4: drop the paragraph "Each integration… \ref{sec:annex-rollout}"
   (the annex-F-pointing paragraph); §4 is too long.
3. (30) §5 cohort presentation: replace the model enumeration with:
   models are listed on Figure~\ref{fig:reliability} and include
   Claude, DeepSeek, Mistral and Qwen at various sizes from
   workstation to frontier.
4. (12) §5: drop the language-family considerations entirely (L508
   "three language families (EN/FR/ZH)") — irrelevant, false (models
   are natively multilingual), and removes the claim of multiple
   representatives for all three languages. Sweep for residual
   language-family text elsewhere.
5. (33) L546/L549: "firmly inside every cutoff" + "solidly
   substantiated" in the same passage = AI English — delete/reword.
6. (34, 35) The repeatedly-referenced undefined "bar" (L548–551,
   L614 "seeded recall bar"): replace the verbose/obscure "seeded
   recall bar" phrasing with the plain term "answer key", defining it
   clearly at first use (or drop the bar metaphor).
7. (32) Float Figure 3 (fig:direct-base, L602) two pages earlier, on
   its own page, as Figure 4 is.
8. (29) Annex F: add a note on the emerging capability to swarm,
   orchestrate, and act as a team.

